This project was inspired by mcp-server-ietf, an MCP server for fetching IETF
documents:

    https://github.com/tizee/mcp-server-ietf

rfc-ai-tooling is an independent implementation with a different data model,
distribution strategy, and tool surface. The index-parsing approach in
`core/rfc.py` — matching RFC entries by a leading number and special-casing
"Not Issued" placeholders — follows the approach taken in that project's
`src/mcp_server_ietf/rfc_parser.py`. That file is reproduced nowhere here, and
the parser was rewritten to correct defects described in the README.

